From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ludovic Henry <git@ludovic.dev>
Date: Mon, 06 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] lance-context-core: drop the unused lance-graph dependency

crates/lance-context-core/Cargo.toml depends on `lance-graph = "0.5.4"`,
but no Rust source file in this workspace imports `lance_graph`
(`grep -rln lance_graph crates/ python/` matches nothing); it is dead
weight in the dependency graph. lance-graph's own Cargo.toml pins
`lance`/`lance-core`/`lance-linalg` at an incompatible `1.x` line, which
Cargo resolves as a second, parallel copy of the whole lance-core/
lance-linalg family alongside the `7.0.0` one `crates/lance-context-core`
depends on directly (`lance = "7.0.0"`). That `1.x` copy's lance-core
SIMD_SUPPORT closure and lance-linalg's f32x8/f32x16/i32x8/f64x4/f64x8
SIMD types have no riscv64 fallback either, and Cargo's `[patch]` table
can only redirect one semver-incompatible version of a given crate name
at a time (verified empirically: patching crates-io `foo` to a local
`1.0.0` copy while another dependency requires `foo = "2"` fails
resolution with "candidate versions found which didn't match"), so
patching lance-core/lance-linalg 7.0.0 for riscv64 (see
0003-cargo-patch-lance-crates-for-riscv64.patch and
0002/0004-lance-{core,linalg}-riscv64-simd-fallback.patch) cannot also
cover the unused 1.x copy lance-graph alone drags in. Removing the dead
dependency drops that whole second copy from resolution instead.

Upstream-Status: To upstream [not yet submitted to lance-format/lance-context]

Signed-off-by: Ludovic Henry <git@ludovic.dev>
---
 crates/lance-context-core/Cargo.toml | 1 -
 1 file changed, 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/crates/lance-context-core/Cargo.toml b/crates/lance-context-core/Cargo.toml
index c47d8c8..98dda4c 100644
--- a/crates/lance-context-core/Cargo.toml
+++ b/crates/lance-context-core/Cargo.toml
@@ -30,7 +30,6 @@ lance-context-api = { version = "0.6.5", path = "../lance-context-api" }
 lance-index = "7.0.0"
 lance-namespace = "7.0.0"
 lancedb = "0.30.0"
-lance-graph = "0.5.4"
 # Version-matched with lance-context-server/-master so one process-wide recorder
 # serves every crate.
 metrics = { version = "0.24", optional = true }
--
2.43.0
